5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am a little worried about who will actually do the extra work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I worry about promising dates when we cannot control access at customer sites.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about where the money actually comes from. The budget line matters more than the idea.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I am curious why we keep picking the same types of projects. The history is right there, waiting to be read.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I keep seeing us judge ideas by how impressive they sound, not by the small daily losses on the floor.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,I wonder if we check who is already busy before adding more tasks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, that is a fair point. I am also checking the in-house developer availability to see who is actually free.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, I will look into the capital budget and software allowance. I need to know the real source of funds.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, the budget is vital, but I need to see the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts. I want to know what actually survived.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, I agree. I will look into the time lost to copying existing records. That daily friction is often ignored.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look into the staffing of the coordination group. I want to see if the rota is already full.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will check the network coverage at customer plants. If the signal is weak, our timelines are fiction.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also check the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work. I need to see if the renewal costs are hidden in the initial quote.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will also check the record of cross-unit standardization efforts. I want to see if we actually share the lessons learned or just repeat them.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also check the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs. I want to see the real weekly friction on the floor.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the coordination group is not already stretched too thin. I will see what the records say.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will see if the signal holds up under real load. Quiet confidence is not the same as readiness.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will see if the renewal notice matches the initial quote. The real bill often arrives later.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"I will see if the pattern holds. If we keep repeating the same mistakes, the history is screaming at us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will see if the logs show a pattern. Small daily losses add up to real pain.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
