35,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found the coordination group is very thin. Only two people write all the notes by hand.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The network data is sobering. Half the sites lose signal for afternoons, and visitor approval took six weeks. That is a major risk.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room. However, per-head licences climb with every department added.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The pattern is clear. Broad, daily-entry tools get abandoned. Narrow, trade-specific ones survive. We keep ignoring that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The logs show eleven misrouted deliveries, all from duplicate addresses. Plus, we lose an hour daily just copying records. That is real, daily friction.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, if the developers are busy until the third quarter, who will actually build the new tools?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, that is the crux. The integrator left no documentation, so we are starting from zero. I will check the developer availability to confirm the gap.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@May, that aligns with my findings. Per-head licences punish broad adoption. We must avoid tools that scale with headcount.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, exactly. The data proves broad tools die. We need something narrow and specific, not another bloated platform.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, the daily copying loss is a symptom of that thin staffing. We need to fix the root cause, not just add more hands.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I agree. The two people are already overwhelmed. Adding more tasks will just break the rota further.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@George, the frozen capital line is a hard constraint. We cannot rely on new hardware. We must work within the existing software allowance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, precisely. The capital freeze means we must live within the recurring software allowance. I will not sign off on anything requiring new hardware.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, that thin staffing explains why broad tools fail. If no one owns the daily entry, it dies. We need a narrow tool that one person can maintain.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, that is a wise insight. A narrow tool fits the daily rhythm better. I will look for something that reduces that copying burden without adding complexity.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am a little quiet now. I just want to make sure we do not add more weight to those two people.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am glad we are aligning on the constraints. The quiet reality is that we cannot build what we cannot access.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I am satisfied with the financial picture. The recurring allowance is our only safe harbor. Let us see which candidates fit that reality.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I am ready to see the candidates. The history is clear; now we just need to pick the one that respects it.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am ready to see the candidates. I want to find the one that eases the daily friction without adding more weight to the team.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
